 "description": "Paid URL: 0.10 USDC per call on Base; 10 signed-wallet free calls shared over rolling 30 days. Read the backend 402 body for x402 terms. Evaluate supplied alternatives against explicit weighted numeric criteria and constraints, with transparent scores, evidence gaps and ties.\nOperating boundary: Scores use supplied evidence and measurements only. Missing evidence, failed constraints and ties are disclosed. No independent truth or optimality claim.\nPOST /api/agent-decision-packet-rail. Existing product credentials, signed mandates, and single-use action grants remain required where applicable. This adapter grants no authority and never supplies server credentials. Wallet-authenticated bounded operations service with durable records. See /api/operations-contract for exact schemas, verified scope and unavailable capabilities.",
